claim.claim-text:
determining (402) that a user provided a spoken utterance to an automated assistant, wherein the computing device provides access to the automated assistant via one or more automated assistant interfaces;
identifying (404), based on processing the spoken utterance, an action for an application to perform, wherein the application is separate from the automated assistant;
determining (412), based on the spoken utterance, a duration of a delay before initializing the action via an action request provided by the automated assistant;
causing (414) an action impending notification to be rendered, in a foreground of a graphical user interface for the duration of the delay, wherein the action-impending notification comprises:
a characterization of content of the action request, and
a dynamic graphical representation that characterizes a real-time expiration of the duration of the delay;
